# 基础词 Unit02
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2025红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit02核心词汇

{{advocate}}{{/ˈædvəkeɪt}}{{v./n. 提倡；倡导者}}{{Many scientists advocate for renewable energy sources.}}
{{affair}}{{/əˈfeər}}{{n. 事务；事件}}{{The government is dealing with several important affairs.}}
{{affect}}{{/əˈfekt}}{{v. 影响；感动}}{{The new policy will affect millions of workers.}}
{{afford}}{{/əˈfɔːd}}{{v. 负担得起；提供}}{{They cannot afford to buy a house in the city center.}}
{{afraid}}{{/əˈfreɪd}}{{adj. 害怕的；恐惧的}}{{She is afraid of speaking in public.}}
{{after}}{{/ˈɑːftər}}{{prep./conj. 在…之后}}{{After graduation, she moved to Beijing for work.}}
{{afterward}}{{/ˈɑːftəwəd}}{{adv. 后来；以后}}{{We had dinner and afterward went to see a movie.}}
{{again}}{{/əˈɡen}}{{adv. 又；再次}}{{Please say that again more slowly.}}
{{against}}{{/əˈɡenst}}{{prep. 反对；靠着}}{{They voted against the proposal in the meeting.}}
{{age}}{{/eɪdʒ}}{{n. 年龄；时代}}{{Children of all ages enjoy reading fairy tales.}}
{{agency}}{{/ˈeɪdʒənsi}}{{n. 代理机构；部门}}{{She works for a government agency.}}
{{agenda}}{{/əˈdʒendə}}{{n. 议程；日程安排}}{{The meeting agenda includes three main topics.}}
{{aggressive}}{{/əˈɡresɪv}}{{adj. 侵略性的；有进取心的}}{{The company adopted an aggressive marketing strategy.}}
{{ago}}{{/əˈɡəʊ}}{{adv. 以前}}{{I visited Paris two years ago.}}
{{agree}}{{/əˈɡriː}}{{v. 同意；一致}}{{I agree with your opinion on this matter.}}
{{agriculture}}{{/ˈæɡrɪkʌltʃər}}{{n. 农业}}{{Agriculture is the backbone of the country's economy.}}
{{ahead}}{{/əˈhed}}{{adv. 在前面；提前}}{{Please go ahead and start the meeting without me.}}
{{aid}}{{/eɪd}}{{n./v. 帮助；援助}}{{The Red Cross provided aid to the earthquake victims.}}
{{aim}}{{/eɪm}}{{n./v. 目标；瞄准}}{{The aim of the project is to reduce pollution.}}
{{aircraft}}{{/ˈeəkrɑːft}}{{n. 飞机；航空器}}{{The aircraft landed safely despite the bad weather.}}
{{alarm}}{{/əˈlɑːm}}{{n./v. 警报；使惊恐}}{{The fire alarm went off in the middle of the night.}}
{{album}}{{/ˈælbəm}}{{n. 相册；专辑}}{{The band released their new album last month.}}
{{alcohol}}{{/ˈælkəhɒl}}{{n. 酒精；酒}}{{Excessive consumption of alcohol is harmful to health.}}
{{alert}}{{/əˈlɜːt}}{{adj./v./n. 警觉的；提醒}}{{The government issued an alert about the approaching typhoon.}}
{{alien}}{{/ˈeɪliən}}{{n./adj. 外国人；外星人；陌生的}}{{The concept of alien life fascinates many scientists.}}
{{alike}}{{/əˈlaɪk}}{{adj./adv. 相似的；一样地}}{{The twins look very much alike.}}
{{alive}}{{/əˈlaɪv}}{{adj. 活着的；有活力的}}{{She is the only person alive who witnessed the event.}}
{{allow}}{{/əˈlaʊ}}{{v. 允许；准许}}{{Smoking is not allowed in this building.}}
{{ally}}{{/ˈælaɪ}}{{n./v. 同盟国；结盟}}{{The two countries became close allies during the war.}}
{{almost}}{{/ˈɔːlməʊst}}{{adv. 几乎；差不多}}{{Almost all students passed the final exam.}}
{{alone}}{{/əˈləʊn}}{{adj./adv. 独自的；单独地}}{{She lives alone in a small apartment.}}
{{along}}{{/əˈlɒŋ}}{{prep./adv. 沿着；一起}}{{We walked along the river for an hour.}}
{{alongside}}{{/əˌlɒŋˈsaɪd}}{{prep./adv. 在…旁边；并排}}{{The new building stands alongside the old one.}}
{{alphabet}}{{/ˈælfəbet}}{{n. 字母表}}{{Children learn the alphabet before they start reading.}}
{{alter}}{{/ˈɔːltər}}{{v. 改变；修改}}{{They had to alter the plan due to bad weather.}}
{{alternative}}{{/ɔːlˈtɜːnətɪv}}{{n./adj. 替代品；可选择的}}{{We need to find an alternative solution to this problem.}}
{{although}}{{/ɔːlˈðəʊ}}{{conj. 虽然；尽管}}{{Although it was raining, we still went hiking.}}
{{altogether}}{{/ˌɔːltəˈɡeðər}}{{adv. 完全地；总共}}{{The project was altogether successful.}}
{{aluminum}}{{/əˈluːmɪnəm}}{{n. 铝}}{{Aluminum is widely used in the aerospace industry.}}
{{always}}{{/ˈɔːlweɪz}}{{adv. 总是；一直}}{{She always arrives at work on time.}}
{{amateur}}{{/ˈæmətər}}{{n./adj. 业余爱好者；业余的}}{{He is an amateur photographer who takes stunning pictures.}}
{{amaze}}{{/əˈmeɪz}}{{v. 使惊奇；使惊叹}}{{The magician's tricks amazed the audience.}}
{{ambassador}}{{/æmˈbæsədər}}{{n. 大使；代表}}{{The ambassador represented his country at the conference.}}
{{ambition}}{{/æmˈbɪʃn}}{{n. 雄心；抱负}}{{Her ambition is to become a successful entrepreneur.}}
{{ambulance}}{{/ˈæmbjələns}}{{n. 救护车}}{{The ambulance arrived within minutes of the emergency call.}}
{{among}}{{/əˈmʌŋ}}{{prep. 在…之中}}{{She is among the top students in her class.}}
{{amount}}{{/əˈmaʊnt}}{{n./v. 数量；总计}}{{A large amount of money was spent on research.}}
{{amuse}}{{/əˈmjuːz}}{{v. 使娱乐；使发笑}}{{The comedian's jokes amused the entire audience.}}
{{analyse/analyze}}{{/ˈænəlaɪz}}{{v. 分析}}{{Scientists analyzed the data from the experiment.}}
{{ancestor}}{{/ˈænsestər}}{{n. 祖先；祖宗}}{{Our ancestors lived in small villages thousands of years ago.}}
